    "sentence_translations": [
      "How Do We Get To the Hotel?",
      "",
      "Ben: Lili, how are our preparations going?",
      "",
      "Lili: Almost done! I have already booked our hotels for Nanjing and Suzhou.",
      "Little Yan has already bought our high-speed train tickets to Nanjing and return tickets to Beijing.",
      "",
      "Ben: So after we arrive in Nanjing, how do we get to the hotel?",
      "",
      "Lili: We can take a taxi!",
      "",
      "Ben: How much does taking a taxi cost?",
      "",
      "Lili: Umm … It’s a little expensive, about 100 yuan.",
      "",
      "Ben: That’s too expensive. Is there a bus?",
      "",
      "Lili: There is, but … we must “zhuanche”.",
      "",
      "Ben: What does “zhuanche” mean?",
      "",
      "Lili: “Zhuanche” means “transfer bus”.",
      "",
      "Ben: So “zhuan feiji” means “transfer plane”.",
      "",
      "Lili: That’s clever! “Transfer plane” is “zhuanji”.",
      "",
      "Ben: I don’t like transferring buses and planes. Forget it. How about the subway?",
      "",
      "Lili: I’ll look at the map. There is a subway!",
      "We can first take subway Line 3, and then transfer to Line 4. Then it’s a 5-minute walk to the hotel.",
      "",
      "Ben: Okay, let’s take the subway!",
      ""
    ]
  }
